To use a Gaussian filter before applying the Sobel operator, you can add a convolution step with a Gaussian kernel. Here's the modified code:

```matlab
input_image = imread('image.jpg'); % Read input image
gray_image = rgb2gray(input_image); % Convert to grayscale

