echo "<pre>"; print_r($orderedSet); echo "</pre>";

$orderedSet = smart_sort_array($set, 'desc'); // Sort in descending order
echo "<pre>"; print_r($orderedSet); echo "</pre>";
```

This will output the sorted arrays in ascending and descending orders respectively.

